sequenceDiagram
  participant Pipe as AuthorityPipelineStagesExecutor
  participant Stage as Decisioning stage
  participant Dec as ArchLucid.Decisioning
  participant Packs as Policy packs / governance
  participant SQL as Tenant SQL catalog
  Note over Pipe,Stage: OTel span authority.decisioning<br/>tag archlucid.stage.name

  Pipe->>Stage: Run after findings
  Stage->>Dec: Resolve decisions from findings + graph
  Dec->>Packs: Apply effective governance / policy packs
  Dec->>SQL: Persist decision candidates / traces (pre-finalize)
  Stage-->>Pipe: Stage complete → next authority.artifacts
